  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd7a17e8574df2347a003396da4a7477, type: 2}
    text: Halt, little clown! Honk Street is full of bumper cars today.
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd7a17e8574df2347a003396da4a7477, type: 2}
    text: Make it to the other side without a bump and I'll call you the bravest
      clown in town!
